      "content_markdown": "$$= \\frac{\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta}{\\sin\\theta \\cdot \\cos\\theta}$$\n$$= \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta \\cdot \\cos\\theta} [\\because \\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1]$$\n$$= \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$$\n$$= \\text{cosec}\\theta \\cdot \\sec\\theta$$\n$$= \\sec\\theta \\cdot \\text{cosec}\\theta = \\text{Right hand side (Proved)}$$",
